log10.t.sol
├── when x is zero
│  └── it should revert
└── when x is not zero
   ├── when x is negative
   │  └── it should revert
   └── when x is positive
      ├── when x is a power of ten
      │  └── it should return the correct value
      └── when x is not a power of ten
         └── it should return the correct value

Additional decimal boundary cases
├── all representable exact powers and their valid immediate neighbors
│  └── it should preserve exact values and stay within the neighboring decade bounds
├── immediately above ten
│  └── it should return the exact decade lower bound
└── the maximum input
   └── it should stay within the final representable decade
